    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1040">

                <pb facs="1046" n="926" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg926"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                    Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 213.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inc se copy of a letter from Messrs.
                    Nicoll, Anable &amp; Lindsay, requesting that instructions should be sent to you
                    to confer with the counsel of the New York and Bermudez Company on the condition
                    of its affairs.</p>
                <p>The writers were advised that instructions were unnecessary and you would
                    undoubtedly confer with the counsel when he should call on you.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1040-a1.xml" xpointer="d1040-a1"/>
            </div>
